Wait+Screen@10s /step 3 of 11/
Screenshot out/@NAME@-proxmox.png
Type "127.0.0.1:8006"
Sleep 450ms
Tab
Type "root@pam"
Sleep 450ms
Tab
Type "demo-password"
Sleep 450ms
Tab
Sleep 450ms
Tab
Sleep 450ms
Right
Sleep 650ms
Enter
Sleep 450ms

