# ==================== STEP 9: files ====================
# ValidateFilePath expands a leading "~/" via the real OS user's home
# (system.InvokingUserHomeDir, not $HOME — see internal/system/elevation.go),
# so a literal "~/pull-secret.json" validates against the operator's real
# home, not $OKDCTL_DEMO_HOME. Type the demo home's absolute path instead.
Wait+Screen@10s /step 9 of 11/
Screenshot out/@NAME@-files.png
Type "@HOME@/pull-secret.json"
Sleep 450ms
Tab
Type "@HOME@/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub"
Sleep 450ms
Tab
Type "/var/www/html"
Sleep 650ms
Enter
Sleep 450ms

